  <text xml:lang="grc"><body xml:base="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0011.troilos.dindorf1893-grc1"><div type="edition" n="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0011.troilos.dindorf1893-grc1" xml:lang="grc" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0011_troilos"><head>ΤΡΩΙΛΟΣ</head><div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="548" xml:id="fragment-troilos-dindorf1893_grc1-548" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0011_troilos" sameAs="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0011.troilos.nauck1889grc1:561">
            <note type="source">Schol. Pindari Nem. III, 60. Περὶ δὲ τῆς μεταμορφώσεως τῆς Θέτιδος καὶ Σοφοκλῆς φησιν ἐν Τρωίλῳ</note>
            <lg type="fragment">
              <l n="1" xml:lang="grc">Ἔγημεν ὡς ἔγημεν ἀφθόγγους γάμους,</l>
              <l n="2" xml:lang="grc">τῇ παντομόρφῳ Θέτιδι συμπλακεὶς ποτέ.</l>
            </lg>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="549" xml:id="fragment-troilos-dindorf1893_grc1-549" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0011_troilos" sameAs="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0011.troilos.nauck1889grc1:563">
            <note type="source">Pollux X, 165. Ξίφους δὲ ὄνομα ἔοικεν εἶναι βαρβαρικὸν ἡ σκαλμὴ, Σοφοκλέους εἰπόντος ἐν Τρωίλῳ</note>
            <lg type="fragment">
              <l n="1" xml:lang="grc">Σκαλμῇ γὰρ ὄρχεις βασιλὶς ἐκτέμνουσ᾽ ἐμούς.</l>
            </lg>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="550" xml:id="fragment-troilos-dindorf1893_grc1-550" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0011_troilos" sameAs="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0011.troilos.nauck1889grc1:568">
            <note type="source">Hesychius, Ἀμάσεται· ἀπὸ τῆς ἀμήσεως. οἱονεὶ σφάξει (codex σφάξαι). Σ. Τρωιλῳ.</note>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="551" xml:id="fragment-troilos-dindorf1893_grc1-551" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0011_troilos" sameAs="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0011.troilos.nauck1889grc1:562">
            <note type="source">Scholiasta Pindari Pyth. II, 121. Σοφοκλῆς ἐπὶ τοῦ Τρωίλου</note>
            <lg type="fragment">
              <l n="1" xml:lang="grc">Τὸν ἀνδρόπαιδα δεσπότης ἀπώλεσα.</l>
            </lg>
            <note type="commentary">δεσπότην Blomfildus. Hesychius, Ἀνδρόπαις· ἀνδρούμενος ἤδη παῖς, ἢ ἀνδρὸς φρόνησιν ἔχων παῖς. Σ. Τρωίλῳ.</note>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="552" xml:id="fragment-troilos-dindorf1893_grc1-552" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0011_troilos" sameAs="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0011.troilos.nauck1889grc1:569">
            <note type="source">Hesychius, Ἀπεσκη· τόξον ἀπέσκη. ἔνιοι δὲ γυμνὰ θήκαις τόξα. Σ. Τρωίλῳ. Corrige θήκης ex Bekkeri Anecd. p. 422, 33. Ἀπέσκη· γυμνὰ θήκης τόξα.</note>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="553" xml:id="fragment-troilos-dindorf1893_grc1-553" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0011_troilos" sameAs="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0011.troilos.nauck1889grc1:570">
            <note type="source">Hesychius, Ἄπιστος· ἀπαράπιστος, ἀπειθής. Σ. Τρωίλῳ.</note>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="554" xml:id="fragment-troilos-dindorf1893_grc1-554" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0011_troilos">
            <note type="source">Hesychius, Ἄσας· βλάψας, ἔβλαψας. Σ. Τρωίλῳ.</note>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="555" xml:id="fragment-troilos-dindorf1893_grc1-555" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0011_troilos" sameAs="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0011.troilos.nauck1889grc1:572">
            <note type="source">Hesychius, Ἀσόλοικον· ἥμερον, προσηνές, οὐ βάρβαρον. Σ. Τρωίλῳ.</note>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="556" xml:id="fragment-troilos-dindorf1893_grc1-556" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0011_troilos" sameAs="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0011.troilos.nauck1889grc1:567">
            <note type="source">Hesychius, Ἐλαιοῦται θρίξ· Σ. Τρωίλῳ. Ἀρίσταρχος, ῥυπαίνεται. βέλτιον δὲ, λαμπρύνεται.</note>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="557" xml:id="fragment-troilos-dindorf1893_grc1-557" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0011_troilos">
            <note type="source">Hesychius, Ἕρκη· ὅπλα. Σ. Τρωίλῳ.</note>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="558" xml:id="fragment-troilos-dindorf1893_grc1-558" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0011_troilos" sameAs="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0011.troilos.nauck1889grc1:575">
            <note type="source">Iaí: vide fragm. 54. Hesychius, Ιήιος· —ἀλλὰ καὶ θρῆνον σημαίνει, ὡς Σ. Τρωίλῳ.</note>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="559" xml:id="fragment-troilos-dindorf1893_grc1-559" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0011_troilos" sameAs="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0011.troilos.nauck1889grc1:565">
            <note type="source">Hesychius, Καταρβύλοις· χλαίναις ποδήρεσιν, ὥστε καὶ ἐπὶ τὰς ἀρβύλας χαλᾶσθαι. Σ. Τρωίλῳ. Ad hunc locum fortasse pertinet glossa Καθάρβυλος.</note>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="560" xml:id="fragment-troilos-dindorf1893_grc1-560" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0011_troilos" sameAs="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0011.troilos.nauck1889grc1:564">
            <note type="source">Etymolog. M. p. 597, 44. Ναρόν· τὸ ὑγρόν. Σ. Τρωίλῳ</note>
            <lg type="fragment">
              <l n="1" xml:lang="grc">Πρὸς ναρὰ δὲ κρηναῖα χωροῦμεν ποτά.</l>
            </lg>
            <note type="commentary">Conf. Orionem p. 110, 3. Etymolog. Gud. p. 627, 14. et Havn. in Sturzii annotatione p. 978.</note>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="561" xml:id="fragment-troilos-dindorf1893_grc1-561" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0011_troilos" sameAs="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0011.troilos.nauck1889grc1:577">
            <note type="source">Ὀροσάγγαι: vide fragm. 193.</note>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="562" xml:id="fragment-troilos-dindorf1893_grc1-562" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0011_troilos" sameAs="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0011.troilos.pearson1917-grc1:635">
            <note type="source">Photius p. 497, 3. (conf. Biblioth. Coislin. p. 475.) Σακοδερμίτης· Σ. Τρωίλῳ. οἱ μὲν τὸν ὄφιν, οἱ δὲ σκώληκα τὰ δέρματα διεσθίοντα. ἄμεινον δὲ</note>
          </div>
        </div></body></text></TEI>
